"Some earlier wallet files were moved to a separate folder on this iPhone and the others were left in place. Nothing was deleted. Try again, or contact SORA support." = "部分先前的錢包檔案已移到此 iPhone 上的單獨資料夾，其餘檔案保留原位。未刪除任何內容。請再試一次或聯繫 SORA 支援。";
