"Create or import an account" = "創建或導入帳戶";
"Upgrade wallet" = "升級錢包";
"Upgrade your wallet" = "升級您的錢包";
"This version moves your wallet to a safer storage format. It only takes a moment." = "此版本會將錢包遷移到更安全的儲存格式。只需片刻。";
"Your original keys are not deleted or replaced" = "不會刪除或替換您的原始金鑰";
"If a check fails, SORA stops safely and shows your options" = "如果檢查失敗，SORA 會安全停止並顯示可選操作";
"What happens during the upgrade?" = "升級期間會發生什麼？";
"SORA found a wallet created by an older app version." = "SORA 找到了由舊版App創建的錢包。";
"SORA checks the recovery data saved by the older version, derives the same SORA account from it, and saves that account in a way that survives interruptions." = "SORA 會檢查舊版保存的恢複資料，從中衍生相同的 SORA 帳戶，並以可在操作中斷後復原的方式保存該帳戶。";
"The original Keychain entry is not deleted or replaced in this release. If any check fails, SORA stops and shows your recovery options instead of creating another wallet." = "此版本不會刪除或替換原始鑰匙圈條目。如果任何檢查失敗，SORA 會停止並顯示復原選項，而不會創建另一個錢包。";
"Updating your wallet. Keep SORA open until this finishes." = "正在更新錢包。完成之前請保持 SORA 打開。";
"We paused to keep your wallet safe" = "我們已暫停操作以保護您的錢包";
"Copy recovery details" = "複製復原詳情";
"Create protected recovery export" = "創建受保護的復原導出檔案";
