"If setting the records aside does not help, contact SORA support with the app version shown below. Never share your recovery phrase." = "如果單獨存放記錄仍無幫助，請聯繫 SORA 支援並提供下方的App版本。切勿分享復原助記詞。";
"SORA also cannot read its records of transactions that were still being confirmed. You can set these records aside below. Nothing is deleted." = "SORA 也無法讀取仍在確認中的交易記錄。您可以在下方將這些記錄單獨存放。不會刪除任何內容。";
"SORA could not read its records of transactions that were still being confirmed when it last checked. Your accounts, keys and funds are not affected." = "上次檢查時，SORA 無法讀取仍在確認中的交易記錄。您的帳戶、金鑰和資金不受影響。";
"Try again. If this screen appears again, contact SORA support with the app version shown below. Never share your recovery phrase." = "請再試一次。如果此螢幕再次出現，請聯繫 SORA 支援並提供下方的App版本。切勿分享復原助記詞。";
