"SORA will start fresh on this iPhone. Wallet keys saved on this iPhone are not deleted, and the earlier wallet data is moved to a separate folder on this iPhone. You can restore any wallet with its recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. Wallets with a saved ownership PIN can also be restored with that PIN." = "SORA 將在此 iPhone 上重新開始。此 iPhone 上保存的錢包金鑰不會被刪除，先前的錢包資料會移到此 iPhone 上的單獨資料夾。您可以使用錢包的復原助記詞或 Google Drive 備份復原任何錢包。保存了所有權 PIN 的錢包也可以使用該 PIN 復原。";
"SORA will start fresh on this iPhone. Wallet keys saved on this iPhone are not deleted. You can restore any wallet later with its recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. Wallets with a saved ownership PIN can also be restored from Add account with that PIN." = "SORA 將在此 iPhone 上重新開始。此 iPhone 上保存的錢包金鑰不會被刪除。以後您可以使用復原助記詞或 Google Drive 備份復原任何錢包。保存了所有權 PIN 的錢包也可以在“添加帳戶”中使用該 PIN 復原。";
"Restore a historical wallet" = "復原歷史錢包";
"For a 3-, 6-, or 9-word phrase, enter the SORA address of the wallet you want to restore. The phrase and derivation path must match this address before any keys are saved." = "對於 3、6 或 9 個單詞的助記詞，請輸入要復原的錢包的 SORA 地址。保存任何金鑰前，助記詞和衍生路徑必須與此地址匹配。";
"A phrase with fewer than 12 words is much easier to guess. After restoring, create a new wallet with a 24-word phrase and move your funds to it." = "少於 12 個單詞的助記詞被猜到的風險高得多。復原後，請用 24 個單詞的助記詞建立新錢包，並將資金轉入其中。";
"Move your funds to a new wallet" = "請將資金轉入新錢包";
